From be665098775a13e596961aa0eece5a427e3706db Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Nick Hamilton <nick.hamilton@imgtec.com>
Date: Tue, 31 Mar 2026 13:36:30 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] pvr: Fixes for gs_rta_support when uisng 2D array view on a
 3D image.

When generating the emit state for a 2D array view of a 3D image the
array layer size should not be taken into account as the rta is
iterating over each z slice of the image. Otherwise each iteration
will apply both the layer and z slice offset leading to an incorrect
address been calculated.

Fix for the following tests with gs_rta_support enabled:
dEQP-VK.renderpass.remaining_array_layers.multi_layer_fb.*

Signed-off-by: Nick Hamilton <nick.hamilton@imgtec.com>
Acked-by: Luigi Santivetti <luigi.santivetti@imgtec.com>
Reviewed-by: Frank Bouwer <frank.bouwer@imgtec.com>
Part-of: <https://gitlab.freedesktop.org/mesa/mesa/-/merge_requests/40973>
Link: https://gitlab.freedesktop.org/mesa/mesa/-/commit/be665098775a13e596961aa0eece5a427e3706db
---
 src/imagination/vulkan/pvr_arch_cmd_buffer.c | 4 +++-
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/src/imagination/vulkan/pvr_arch_cmd_buffer.c b/src/imagination/vulkan/pvr_arch_cmd_buffer.c
index 11e3bbf6c80d..3ebfd63c56a6 100644
--- a/src/imagination/vulkan/pvr_arch_cmd_buffer.c
+++ b/src/imagination/vulkan/pvr_arch_cmd_buffer.c
@@ -1577,8 +1577,10 @@ pvr_setup_emit_state(const struct pvr_device_info *dev_info,
             continue;
 
          const struct pvr_image *image = pvr_image_view_get_image(iview);
+
          if (PVR_HAS_FEATURE(dev_info, gs_rta_support) &&
-             rstate->layers > 1) {
+             rstate->layers > 1 &&
+             image->memlayout != PVR_MEMLAYOUT_3DTWIDDLED) {
             const struct pvr_image_plane *plane = pvr_single_plane_const(image);
 
             emit_state->layer_size[emit_state->emit_count] = plane->layer_size;
